    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_industrial_minerals; processing_state=unspecified; wd_term=graphite; wd_relation=skos:broadMatch): Black lead / plumbago is graphite (Simmonds 1892 s.v. BLACK LEAD: 'See GRAPHITE and PLUMBAGO'; McCulloch 1880 s.v. BLACK LEAD); filed with Plumbago (htc:0130), not with lead metal or metallic ores. Layer-1 observations: 15 rows, 1800–1856. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×6; KEW_CUST 5 ×5; KEW_CUST 4 ×2; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×2. Units: Tons ×6; CWTS (Hundredweights) ×5; Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×2; Lbs. (Pounds) ×1. Top routes: Holland → United Kingdom ×2; World → United Kingdom ×2; Canada → England ×2; Italy → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
